cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Finding and Accessing EIC Simulation Files (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Stephen JD
    family-names: Kay
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial on finding and accessing EIC simulation campaign data.
  It covers how simulation output is organised, how to browse and access
  datasets with Rucio and xrootd, how to use metadata tags to locate files,
  and several common analysis use cases. Built with The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - Rucio
  - xrootd
  - simulation campaign
  - data management
  - file access
repository-code: 'https://github.com/eic/tutorial-file-access'
license: CC-BY-4.0
